  "title": "J-Long Group Limited Announces First Half 2024 Unaudited Financial Results",
  "summary": "HONG KONG, March 25, 2024 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — J-Long Group Limited (“JL” or the“Company”) (NASDAQ: JL), JL conducts its primary operations of apparel trims solution services in Hong Kong, today announced its unaudited financial results for the six months ended September 30, 2023. Overview:  Revenue was approximately US$14.6 million for the six months ended […]",
